{"title":"Career Roadmap: Site Planner","role":"Site Planner","summary":"A Site Planner develops the overall organization and functional layout of a site by coordinating buildings, circulation, landscape, open spaces, parking, utilities, drainage, pedestrian movement, and environmental considerations.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Arch (Bachelor of Architecture)","Course":"Landscape Architecture"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Site Planner develops the overall organization and functional layout of a site by coordinating buildings, circulation, landscape, open spaces, parking, utilities, drainage, pedestrian movement, and environmental considerations."},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Arch graduate, this career sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Architecture"},{"text":"Landscape architecture"},{"text":"Site planning"},{"text":"Urban planning"},{"text":"Environmental design"},{"text":"Infrastructure coordination"},{"text":"GIS and spatial analysis"},{"text":"Sustainable development"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A good Site Planner must be able to translate a site survey and development brief into a functional, accessible, buildable, and environmentally responsive site plan."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Site analysis, architectural planning, CAD/BIM, landscape fundamentals, GIS and site-design internships"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Site Planner, Site Planning Consultant, Landscape/Site Designer, Planning Coordinator"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Senior Site Planner, Site Planning Lead, Development Planning Specialist"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Principal Planner, Site Planning Director, Urban Development Consultant, Independent Planning Consultant"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Arch","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Site & Design Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Architectural design"},{"text":"Site analysis"},{"text":"Survey interpretation"},{"text":"Topography"},{"text":"Climate analysis"},{"text":"Orientation"},{"text":"Human movement"},{"text":"Basic landscape design"},{"text":"Open-space planning"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to read:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contour maps"},{"text":"Site boundaries"},{"text":"North direction"},{"text":"Existing vegetation"},{"text":"Access roads"},{"text":"Drainage patterns"},{"text":"Surrounding land uses"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Site Planning Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Site zoning"},{"text":"Building placement"},{"text":"Setbacks"},{"text":"Circulation"},{"text":"Parking"},{"text":"Pedestrian networks"},{"text":"Open-space hierarchy"},{"text":"Landscape planning"},{"text":"Grading fundamentals"},{"text":"Stormwater management"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Learn how to coordinate buildings with the natural characteristics of the site rather than treating the site as a blank surface."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Digital Site Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Build proficiency in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"Revit"},{"text":"SketchUp"},{"text":"Rhino"},{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"Site modelling"},{"text":"3D terrain"},{"text":"Grading concepts"},{"text":"Landscape documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Start working with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GIS layers"},{"text":"Satellite imagery"},{"text":"Contour data"},{"text":"Site-survey information"},{"text":"Spatial datasets"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Professional Site Development"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Development regulations"},{"text":"Site feasibility"},{"text":"Land-use planning"},{"text":"Parking standards"},{"text":"Fire access"},{"text":"Service access"},{"text":"Utility coordination"},{"text":"Stormwater"},{"text":"Universal accessibility"},{"text":"Landscape coordination"},{"text":"Construction documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Practice coordinating with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Architects"},{"text":"Landscape architects"},{"text":"Civil engineers"},{"text":"Structural engineers"},{"text":"MEP consultants"},{"text":"Surveyors"},{"text":"Developers"},{"text":"Local authorities"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 5 — Advanced Site Planning / Thesis"},{"type":"p","text":"Strong thesis topics include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sustainable residential township"},{"text":"University campus master plan"},{"text":"Eco-resort site planning"},{"text":"Healthcare campus"},{"text":"Transit-oriented development"},{"text":"Urban public-space network"},{"text":"Sustainable mixed-use development"},{"text":"Climate-resilient site planning"},{"text":"Waterfront development"},{"text":"Landscape-led urban development"}]}]},{"heading":"Core Technical Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"A. Site Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Site context analysis"},{"text":"Topography"},{"text":"Climate"},{"text":"Solar orientation"},{"text":"Wind"},{"text":"Vegetation"},{"text":"Soil"},{"text":"Hydrology"},{"text":"Existing infrastructure"},{"text":"Surrounding development"},{"text":"Access and connectivity"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A professional site analysis should answer:"},{"type":"flow","items":["What exists?","What are the constraints?","What are the opportunities?","What should be developed?"]},{"type":"h","text":"B. Site Zoning"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how to organize:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Buildings"},{"text":"Roads"},{"text":"Parking"},{"text":"Pedestrian areas"},{"text":"Landscape"},{"text":"Recreation"},{"text":"Utilities"},{"text":"Service areas"},{"text":"Emergency access"},{"text":"Public/private zones"}]},{"type":"h","text":"C. Circulation Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Vehicular"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Main access"},{"text":"Secondary access"},{"text":"Internal roads"},{"text":"Fire access"},{"text":"Service access"},{"text":"Parking"},{"text":"Drop-off areas"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Pedestrian"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Walkways"},{"text":"Universal accessibility"},{"text":"Crossings"},{"text":"Public plazas"},{"text":"Green corridors"},{"text":"Connectivity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sustainable Mobility"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cycling"},{"text":"Public transport integration"},{"text":"EV charging"},{"text":"Walkability"},{"text":"Reduced vehicle dependency"}]}]},{"heading":"Landscape & Environmental Planning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Site Planner should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Plant selection"},{"text":"Native vegetation"},{"text":"Tree preservation"},{"text":"Landscape hierarchy"},{"text":"Green buffers"},{"text":"Shade trees"},{"text":"Outdoor comfort"},{"text":"Water-efficient landscaping"},{"text":"Rain gardens"},{"text":"Bioswales"},{"text":"Permeable surfaces"},{"text":"The goal is to integrate landscape, ecology, and built development rather than treating landscape as decoration added at the end."}]}]},{"heading":"Grading & Drainage Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"You don't necessarily need to become a civil engineer, but you should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contours"},{"text":"Spot levels"},{"text":"Slopes"},{"text":"Cut and fill"},{"text":"Surface drainage"},{"text":"Stormwater flow"},{"text":"Retaining walls"},{"text":"Site levels"},{"text":"Road gradients"},{"text":"Accessible slopes"},{"text":"This is a critical skill because a beautiful site plan that cannot manage water and levels is not a successful site plan."}]}]},{"heading":"Sustainability in Site Planning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Low-impact development"},{"text":"Rainwater management"},{"text":"Permeable paving"},{"text":"Water-sensitive design"},{"text":"Urban heat mitigation"},{"text":"Tree canopy planning"},{"text":"Green infrastructure"},{"text":"Biodiversity"},{"text":"Solar access"},{"text":"Passive outdoor comfort"},{"text":"Sustainable mobility"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For larger developments, understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Stormwater retention"},{"text":"Groundwater recharge"},{"text":"Waste management"},{"text":"Renewable energy"},{"text":"EV infrastructure"},{"text":"Landscape water demand"}]}]},{"heading":"Tools & Software","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Essential"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"Revit"},{"text":"SketchUp"},{"text":"Microsoft Excel"},{"text":"PowerPoint"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Rhino"},{"text":"Grasshopper"},{"text":"Civil 3D"}]},{"type":"h","text":"GIS"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ArcGIS"},{"text":"QGIS"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use GIS for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Site analysis"},{"text":"Land-use mapping"},{"text":"Accessibility analysis"},{"text":"Environmental analysis"},{"text":"Infrastructure mapping"},{"text":"Spatial planning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visualization"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Enscape"},{"text":"Twinmotion"},{"text":"Lumion"},{"text":"V-Ray"},{"text":"D5 Render"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Survey / Terrain"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand workflows involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Total station data"},{"text":"GPS/GNSS survey data"},{"text":"Contours"},{"text":"Drone mapping"},{"text":"LiDAR"},{"text":"Digital elevation models"}]}]},{"heading":"Five Recommended UG Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Residential Township Site Plan"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a small township incorporating:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Housing"},{"text":"Roads"},{"text":"Parking"},{"text":"Parks"},{"text":"Pedestrian routes"},{"text":"Utilities"},{"text":"Community facilities"},{"text":"Stormwater management"},{"text":"Demonstrate how the site works as a complete system."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — University Campus Master Plan"},{"type":"p","text":"Plan:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Academic buildings"},{"text":"Hostels"},{"text":"Sports facilities"},{"text":"Administration"},{"text":"Roads"},{"text":"Pedestrian corridors"},{"text":"Landscape"},{"text":"Parking"},{"text":"Public spaces"},{"text":"Include a phasing strategy for future expansion."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Eco-Resort Site Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Terrain"},{"text":"Vegetation"},{"text":"Water"},{"text":"Views"},{"text":"Solar exposure"},{"text":"Guest circulation"},{"text":"Service access"},{"text":"Minimize disturbance to the natural landscape."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Climate-Resilient Urban Site"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a site plan addressing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Urban heat"},{"text":"Stormwater"},{"text":"Flood risk"},{"text":"Green infrastructure"},{"text":"Tree canopy"},{"text":"Walkability"},{"text":"Public spaces"},{"text":"Include measurable sustainability strategies."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Mixed-Use Development"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a master plan containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Residential"},{"text":"Commercial"},{"text":"Public space"},{"text":"Parking"},{"text":"Pedestrian circulation"},{"text":"Transit access"},{"text":"Landscape"},{"text":"Utilities"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Show:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Site Analysis","Zoning","Circulation","Open Space","Infrastructure","Final Master Plan"]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"h","text":"Architecture Firms"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for projects involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Large developments"},{"text":"Campuses"},{"text":"Residential communities"},{"text":"Master planning"},{"text":"Mixed-use developments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Landscape Architecture Firms"},{"type":"p","text":"Gain experience in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Site design"},{"text":"Planting"},{"text":"Open-space planning"},{"text":"Public spaces"},{"text":"Landscape documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Urban Planning Firms"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Land-use planning"},{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"Mobility"},{"text":"Urban development"},{"text":"Master planning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Real Estate Developers"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Site feasibility"},{"text":"Development planning"},{"text":"Approvals"},{"text":"Infrastructure"},{"text":"Phasing"},{"text":"Project coordination"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Infrastructure / Engineering Consultancies"},{"type":"p","text":"Gain exposure to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Roads"},{"text":"Drainage"},{"text":"Utilities"},{"text":"Grading"},{"text":"Infrastructure coordination"}]}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After B.Arch, suitable roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Site Planner"},{"text":"Junior Site Planner"},{"text":"Site Planning Designer"},{"text":"Landscape/Site Designer"},{"text":"Master Planning Assistant"},{"text":"Urban Design Assistant"},{"text":"Planning Coordinator"},{"text":"Site Development Coordinator"},{"text":"Landscape Planning Assistant"},{"text":"GIS Planning Assistant"},{"text":"Development Planning Analyst"},{"text":"BIM Site Planning Designer"},{"text":"Architectural Planner"}]}]},{"heading":"Employer Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Employer Type","High-Value Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Architecture Firm"},{"text":"Site planning + architecture + BIM"}],[{"text":"Landscape Architecture Firm"},{"text":