oinformatics"},{"text":"Remote Sensing"},{"text":"Urban Analytics"},{"text":"Smart Cities"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. Master Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Large Sites","Zoning","Infrastructure","Phasing"]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Landscape Site Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Open spaces"},{"text":"Planting"},{"text":"Public realm"},{"text":"Landscape ecology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Urban Site Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mixed-use developments"},{"text":"Urban regeneration"},{"text":"Public spaces"},{"text":"Mobility"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Sustainable Site Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Water"},{"text":"Energy"},{"text":"Ecology"},{"text":"Climate resilience"},{"text":"Green infrastructure"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. GIS-Based Site Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Spatial data"},{"text":"Site suitability"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Land-use analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Real Estate Development Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Site feasibility"},{"text":"Development potential"},{"text":"Infrastructure"},{"text":"Phasing"},{"text":"Project economics"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Site Planning / Landscape Internship","Junior Site Planner","Site Planner","Senior Site Planner","Site Planning Lead","Principal Site Planner","Planning Director","Independent Planning Consultant / Practice Founder"]},{"type":"h","text":"Master Planning Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Planning Assistant","Master Planning Designer","Master Planner","Senior Master Planner","Master Planning Lead","Urban Development Consultant","Planning Director"]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"GIS + Spatial Intelligence"},{"type":"p","text":"GIS is becoming increasingly important for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Site suitability"},{"text":"Land-use analysis"},{"text":"Infrastructure mapping"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Environmental assessment"},{"text":"Urban development"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Drone Mapping"},{"type":"p","text":"Drones can generate detailed site information for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Terrain"},{"text":"Vegetation"},{"text":"Existing structures"},{"text":"Construction progress"},{"text":"Site documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"LiDAR & 3D Scanning"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for creating accurate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Terrain models"},{"text":"Existing-condition models"},{"text":"Digital site environments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI-Assisted Site Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"AI and optimization algorithms can help compare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Building placement"},{"text":"Road networks"},{"text":"Solar exposure"},{"text":"Walkability"},{"text":"Parking"},{"text":"Open-space distribution"},{"text":"Development density"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Twins"},{"type":"p","text":"Future large developments may integrate:"},{"type":"flow","items":["GIS","BIM","IoT","Real-Time Data"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"to create digital representations of entire sites or districts."},{"type":"h","text":"Parametric Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Grasshopper and computational methods can help generate and compare multiple site configurations based on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Density"},{"text":"Solar exposure"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Open-space ratios"},{"text":"Circulation"},{"text":"Environmental performance"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"B.Arch"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Site Planning"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Site Analysis"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Landscape Fundamentals"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Urban Design"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Topography"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Grading Fundamentals"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Circulation Planning"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Stormwater Management"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Sustainable Site Design"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Revit / BIM"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"GIS / QGIS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"SketchUp"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Rhino / Grasshopper"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Civil 3D"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"3D Visualization"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Survey Interpretation"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Project Coordination"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Planning Regulations"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to execute:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Site Survey","Context & GIS Analysis","Topography & Climate Analysis","Site Constraints & Opportunities","Development Program","Site Zoning","Building Placement","Road & Pedestrian Network","Parking & Service Access","Landscape & Open Space","Grading & Drainage Strategy","Utilities Coordination","Sustainability Strategy","BIM / CAD Documentation","3D Site Model","Master Site Plan"]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate portfolio should contain 3–5 site-planning projects, including at least one large-scale master plan, one sustainable site, one GIS-based analysis, and one project demonstrating terrain, circulation, landscape, and infrastructure coordination."}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile for this career is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Site Planning","Landscape Fundamentals","GIS","BIM","Urban Design","Sustainable Site Development"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The key advantage is to become a professional who can move from raw site data to a complete, functional development strategy."},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal professional identity"},{"type":"flow","items":["Architect","Spatial Planner","Site Development Specialist"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This combination creates pathways into master planning, landscape-led development, sustainable communities, real-estate development, urban design, GIS-based planning, and large-scale site development."}]}]}